msgid "Defaults for new timers and the Record button. Each timer, and a recording started with \"Record with options…\", can change them.\nTS: video, all audio tracks, subtitles, teletext and EPG data. MKV: video, several audio tracks and subtitles. MPG: video and several audio tracks. MP4: video and one audio track. Internet streams have no teletext, subtitles or EPG data; HLS and DASH streams are recorded with one audio track."
msgstr "Privzete vrednosti za nove časovnike in gumb za snemanje. Vsak časovnik in snemanje, začeto z »Snemaj z možnostmi …«, ju lahko spremeni.\nTS: video, vsi zvočni posnetki, podnapisi, teletekst in podatki EPG. MKV: video, več zvočnih posnetkov in podnapisi. MPG: video in več zvočnih posnetkov. MP4: video in en zvočni posnetek. Spletni tokovi nimajo teleteksta, podnapisov ali podatkov EPG; tokovi HLS in DASH se snemajo z enim zvočnim posnetkom."

