msgstr "Prednostni jezik zvoka"

msgid "Used by \"Preferred language only\" and by MP4, which keeps one track. Audio description tracks are skipped. Without a match the first track is recorded."
msgstr "Uporablja se za »Samo prednostni jezik« in za MP4, ki ohrani en posnetek. Posnetki z zvočnim opisom se preskočijo. Brez ujemanja se posname prvi posnetek."

msgid "{what}: {items} can only be kept in MPEG-TS, so recordings are saved as TS."
msgstr "{what}: {items} je mogoče ohraniti le v MPEG-TS, zato se posnetki shranijo kot TS."

msgid "{what}: {items} can only be kept in TS or MKV, so recordings are saved as TS."
msgstr "{what}: {items} je mogoče ohraniti le v TS ali MKV, zato se posnetki shranijo kot TS."

